            { "kind": "stat", "stat": "smarts", "delta": 6 },
            { "kind": "stat", "stat": "happiness", "delta": -3 }
          ],
          "result": "You studied until midnight. You now know things. Deeply concerning things about mitochondria."
        },
        {
          "id": "slack",
